Below is a brief summary of what’s happening and the minimal edits required to center-align your labels (the `<dt>`) and values (the `<dd>`) within each grid row:

1. In `NameValuePair`, we render each `<dt>` and `<dd>` as direct children of the `Grid` (via a `<dl>`). By default grid items stretch to fill the cell, and your custom `Select` ends up taller than the text label.  
2. To vertically center both the label and the value in their respective grid cells, we can simply give each rendered `<dt>` and `<dd>` an `alignSelf="center"`.

